Article 19

1. Social reintegration services as referred to in Article 12 paragraph (1) letter e, are implemented with the following activities:a. repatriation and/or pick-up of victims; b. population document or identity services; c. alternative family;
d. scholarships and educational support facilities; e. non-formal education;
